  "audit_source": "import BusyBeaver.ZFC.QuotientReplacement\nimport BusyBeaver.ZFC.Code254GIC\n\nopen SetTheory SetTheory.BusyBeaver.ZFC\n\n#print axioms QuotientReplacement.equalityFree_replacementChoiceForm\n#print axioms QuotientReplacement.sat_replacementChoiceForm\n#print axioms QuotientReplacement.replacement_instance\n#print axioms QuotientReplacement.interpreted_replacement\n#print axioms QuotientReplacement.quotient_relOf\n#print axioms QuotientReplacement.quotient_replacement\n#print axioms QuotientReplacement.quotient_repl_form\n\nexample {V : Type} (mem : V \u2192 V \u2192 Prop) (witness : V)\n    (h : ProfileModel.ModelsCPGIC mem)\n    (H : ZFAxioms (QuotientModel.quotientMember mem witness h)) :\n    ZFAxioms (QuotientModel.quotientMember mem witness h) :=\n  { H with repl := QuotientReplacement.quotient_replacement mem witness h }\n\nexample {V : Type} (mem : V \u2192 V \u2192 Prop) (witness : V)\n    (h : ProfileModel.ModelsCPGIC mem) (phi : Form)\n    (env : Nat \u2192 QuotientModel.Domain mem witness h) :\n    Sat (QuotientModel.quotientMember mem witness h) env (sealF (Repl_form phi)) :=\n  (closeN_valid (bound (Repl_form phi)) (Repl_form phi)).mpr\n    (QuotientReplacement.quotient_repl_form mem witness h phi) env\n\nexample {V : Type} (mem : V \u2192 V \u2192 Prop) (hirr : \u2200 x, \u00ac mem x x) (witness : V)\n    (hB : \u2200 f, Code254.EncBundle f \u2192 \u2200 e : Nat \u2192 V, Tarski.Sat mem e f) (phi : Form) :\n    let h := Code254GIC.modelsCPGIC_of_encBundle mem hirr (fun _ => witness) hB\n    \u2200 env, Sat (QuotientModel.quotientMember mem witness h) env (Repl_form phi) :=\n  QuotientReplacement.quotient_repl_form mem witness\n    (Code254GIC.modelsCPGIC_of_encBundle mem hirr (fun _ => witness) hB) phi\n",
